-height:1.5em">Lead a small sales team, including setting the sales and marketing strategy and owning a personal and departmental quota.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Set and execute the operating strategy for the revenue-generating teams in the Urology group, including Sales and Marketing.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Use your industry expertise to inform client relationship building and maintenance, as well as process creation, improvement, and iteration within the group’s revenue-generating teams</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Collaborate with key teams at EngagedMD including Marketing, Product, Video Experience and R&amp;D to launch new products and maximize growth within Urology</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lead, grow, and coach both individuals on the Urology team to achieve group and individual goals</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What You’ll Bring</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">10+ years of experience as a sales, customer success, and /or implementation leader</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Deep knowledge and network of clinic relationships within the Urology industry</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience owning a sales goal with the ability to motivate a sales team.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Proven experience launching and scaling new markets or verticals</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Proven history of meeting revenue goals and other business objectives</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience building teams with a passion for providing mentorship, coaching, and development of the team - ability to influence across departments</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">An ability to model EngagedMD’s core values and action principles</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Prior successful experience working remotely with distributed teams</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.