&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Collaborate with systems and software teams to validate dynamic models against simulation and flight test data.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
