&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Collaborate closely with software developers and hardware engineers to rapidly iterate and improve UAV performance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
