&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience as a UAV / General Aviation pilot (hobbyist, commercial, or military experience).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Be familiar with UAV ground control stations, telemetry systems, and flight planning tools.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
