&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Hands-on knowledge of developing and tuning Ardupilot and PX4 open-source autopilot systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
