&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note:&lt;/strong&gt; This role requires an existing right to work in the UK. We can’t offer visa sponsorship, but we review sponsorship role by role, so keep an eye on our careers site for future opportunities.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;About Kaluza&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kaluza is the Energy Intelligence Platform, turning energy complexity into seamless coordination. We help energy companies overcome today’s challenges while accelerating the shift to a clean, electrified future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our platform orchestrates millions of real-time decisions across homes, devices, markets and grids. By combining predictive algorithms with human-centred design, Kaluza makes clean energy dependable, affordable and adaptive to everyday life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With teams across Europe, Asia and Australia, and a joint venture with Mitsubishi Corporation in Japan, we power leading companies including OVO, AGL and ENGIE, as well as innovators like Volvo and Volkswagen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Pre-Sales Solutions Architect, you’ll sit at the intersection of technology and commercial strategy, shaping how prospective clients understand, adopt and succeed with the Kaluza platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working closely with Pre-Sales Consultants, you’ll lead the technical side of sales engagements, from deep-dive sessions on architecture and data models, through solution design, to handing off to implementation teams at contracting. No two engagements are the same: you might support early-stage prototypes, present at client sites, or advise our Product Architecture team on emerging market needs and common integration patterns.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Discovery and solution design:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead discovery workshops to understand current and target architectures, translate complex requirements into solution designs, and define each client’s “to-be” architecture and integration patterns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Estimate and hand off:&lt;/strong&gt; Estimate work packages so implementation programmes are set up for success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tenders and proposals:&lt;/strong&gt; Provide technical input into tender responses and proposals, and deliver compelling technical presentations with product and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proof of concept:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Pre-Sales Engineering to shape and design proof-of-concept exercises&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product advocacy:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the bridge between market demand and our engineering teams, so client needs shape the roadmap and proposed solutions align with core platform capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measurable outcomes:&lt;/strong&gt; Advise clients on achieving measurable business outcomes through a data-driven approach, and help quantify the value of the platform in commercial conversations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’re a technologist with a strong focus on business outcomes, comfortable running deep technical sessions with architects and setting out a clear strategic vision to C-suite stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ideally, you’ll have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience delivering complex enterprise software implementations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience architecting and building systems, including some of: solutions on AWS, finance and billing platforms, and API technologies such as GraphQL and webhooks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in regulated energy retail, particularly billing, metering and settlements systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication skills, able to distil complex concepts into clear, persuasive messages for a wide range of stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A customer-centric, analytical approach, focused on solving the right problems and using data to measure success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with ambiguity in a fast-paced environment, managing multiple workstreams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motivation from the role technology plays in the global energy transition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What will set you apart:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience architecting SaaS solutions in the energy industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing large-scale, impactful software systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with or for a large energy retailer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Five values guide how we work at Kaluza:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Play to win:&lt;/strong&gt; Collective pride in decarbonising energy at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solve the real problem:&lt;/strong&gt; Cutting through complexity to focus on real-world outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build trust every day:&lt;/strong&gt; Consistency, transparency and doing what we say.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the outcome:&lt;/strong&gt; Full accountability, wins and setbacks, without ego.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Go further together:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaboration, respect and different perspectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time off and family:&lt;/strong&gt; 26 days’ holiday, plus flexible bank holidays (an extra 8 days to take whenever you like) and 26 weeks’ full pay for new parents, with no qualifying service period&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health and security:&lt;/strong&gt; Private medical insurance with virtual GP, life assurance, pension scheme, free mortgage advice and eye tests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay and flexibility:&lt;/strong&gt; Discretionary bonus, a Flex Fund of 5% [of salary] to spend on the benefits you want most, retail discounts through Perks at Work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth and setup:&lt;/strong&gt; Personal learning budget, home office budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Climate:&lt;/strong&gt; Furthr, our climate action app&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Come as you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We want to meet people from all walks of life. The more inclusive we are, the better our work will be, and we recognise talent on merit and potential. If you’re excited about the role but don’t tick every box, we’d still love to hear from you. If you need any adjustments during the process, just let us know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more on our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.kaluza.com/careers/&quot;&gt;careers page&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/kaluza/&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, or read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.kaluza.com/applicant-data-protection-notice/&quot;&gt;Applicant Data Protection Policy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/kaluza/pre-sales-solutions-architect-bristol-london-220406","tags":["Commercial Operations"],"job_types":[],"location":"Bristol; London","created_at":1792205722},{"slug":"appsec-staff-engineer-bristol-333394","company_name":"Kaluza","title":"AppSec Staff Engineer","description":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Bristol, UK (hybrid, three days a week in the office)&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Level:&lt;/strong&gt; Staff Engineer (TL2)&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Security Engineering, within the Cyber Security squad&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary:&lt;/strong&gt; £105,600 – £132,000 + discretionary bonus&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contract:&lt;/strong&gt; Permanent&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting to:&lt;/strong&gt; Senior Software Engineering Manager&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note: &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role requires an existing right to work in &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;the UK&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;. We can’t offer visa sponsorship, but we review sponsorship role by role, so keep an eye on our careers site for future opportunities.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;About Kaluza&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kaluza is the Energy Intelligence Platform, turning energy complexity into seamless coordination. We help energy companies overcome today’s challenges while accelerating the shift to a clean, electrified future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our platform orchestrates millions of real-time decisions across homes, devices, markets and grids. By combining predictive algorithms with human-centred design, Kaluza makes clean energy dependable, affordable and adaptive to everyday life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With teams across Europe, Asia and Australia, and a joint venture with Mitsubishi Corporation in Japan, we power leading companies including OVO, AGL and ENGIE, as well as innovators like Volvo and Volkswagen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll join the Security Engineering team, working alongside our cyber security leadership, architecture team and technical leaders across engineering. Our mission is to equip teams to build and innovate while upholding security best practice and protecting client data in the highly regulated energy sector.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate security tooling and use AI to prevent, detect and respond to emerging threats&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with senior technical leadership to shape our technical strategy and solutions architecture, so security, risk and compliance feed into technical decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help product teams deliver secure systems quickly by building a strong security culture through mentoring, design reviews and training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Give product and engineering teams practical guidance on identifying, prioritising and mitigating systemic risks and vulnerabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the evolution of our security best practice across application development and the wider SDLC, supporting teams with expert advice and automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence technical and non-technical stakeholders across Kaluza and client teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and coach security and software engineers to balance risk with speed and quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build relationships with third-party security vendors and industry bodies to keep us at the forefront of emerging practices, tooling and standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ideally, you’ll have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience mentoring engineers and collaborating closely (e.g. pairing, swarming)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of software security flaws and web application security best practice (OWASP Top 10, CWE/SANS Top 25)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive knowledge of CI/CD and DevOps principles, and their security considerations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience applying AI in your own work and helping others build it safely into how they develop&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scripting skills and first-hand experience of software development at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of Okta or equivalent, to enable workforce identity and enforce access management policies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Awareness of AWS and/or GCP security best practice, and some experience with infrastructure as code (e.g. Terraform)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience applying architectural and software design patterns in a complex environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll also be:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A pragmatic, risk-based decision-maker who weighs the technical and commercial consequences of your choices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled at influencing upwards and outwards, with great communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to set a clear vision for large-scale technical direction and align multiple teams behind it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keen to drive compliance and NFR improvements that balance information security and commercial goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Committed to a culture of learning and improvement, and willing to challenge engineering leadership to support it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills (SFIA):&lt;/strong&gt; We use the &lt;a href=&quot;https://sfia-online.org&quot;&gt;SFIA framework&lt;/a&gt; to assess and develop our security engineers. Levels run from 1 to 7.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Level 6:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://sfia-online.org/en/sfia-9/skills/systems-design&quot;&gt;Systems design&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Level 5:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://sfia-online.org/en/sfia-9/skills/information-security&quot;&gt;Information security&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://sfia-online.org/en/sfia-9/skills/specialist-advice&quot;&gt;specialist advice&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://sfia-online.org/en/sfia-9/skills/systems-software-lifecycle-engineering&quot;&gt;systems development lifecycle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://sfia-online.org/en/sfia-9/skills/solution-architecture&quot;&gt;solution architecture&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://sfia-online.org/en/sfia-9/skills/emerging-technology-monitoring&quot;&gt;emerging technology monitoring&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Level 4:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://sfia-online.org/en/sfia-9/skills/information-assurance&quot;&gt;Information assurance&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://sfia-online.org/en/sfia-9/skills/information-and-data-compliance&quot;&gt;information and data compliance&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desirable:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://sfia-online.org/en/sfia-9/skills/identity-and-access-management&quot;&gt;Identity and access management&lt;/a&gt; (Level 5), &lt;a href=&quot;https://sfia-online.org/en/sfia-9/skills/programming-software-development&quot;&gt;software development&lt;/a&gt; (Level 6), &lt;a href=&quot;https://sfia-online.org/en/sfia-9/skills/learning-delivery&quot;&gt;learning delivery&lt;/a&gt; (Level 3), and &lt;a href=&quot;https://sfia-online.org/en/sfia-9/skills/information-assurance&quot;&gt;information assurance&lt;/a&gt; stepping up to Level 5&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Five values guide how we work at Kaluza:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Play to win:&lt;/strong&gt; Collective pride in decarbonising energy at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solve the real problem:&lt;/strong&gt; Cutting through complexity to focus on real-world outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build trust every day:&lt;/strong&gt; Consistency, transparency and doing what we say.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the outcome:&lt;/strong&gt; Full accountability, wins and setbacks, without ego.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Go further together:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaboration, respect and different perspectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time off and family:&lt;/strong&gt; 26 days’ holiday [plus/including bank holidays], plus 26 weeks’ full pay for new parents with no qualifying service period&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health and security:&lt;/strong&gt; Private medical insurance with virtual GP, life assurance, pension scheme, free mortgage advice and eye tests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay and flexibility:&lt;/strong&gt; Discretionary bonus, a Flex Fund of 5% [of salary] to spend on the benefits you want most, retail discounts through Perks at Work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth and setup:&lt;/strong&gt; Personal learning budget, home office budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Climate:&lt;/strong&gt; Furthr, our climate action app&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Come as you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We want to meet people from all walks of life. The more inclusive we are, the better our work will be, and we recognise talent on merit and potential. If you’re excited about the role but don’t tick every box, we’d still love to hear from you. If you need any adjustments during the process, just let us know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more on our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.kaluza.com/careers/&quot;&gt;careers page&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/kaluza/&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, or read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.kaluza.com/applicant-data-protection-notice/&quot;&gt;Applicant Data Protection Policy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/kaluza/appsec-staff-engineer-bristol-333394","tags":["Engineering"],"job_types":[],"location":"Bristol","created_at":1792205722},{"slug":"senior-manager-hr-operations-london-81451","company_name":"Hudl","title":"Senior Manager, HR Operations","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Hudl, we build great teams. We hire the best of the best to ensure you’re working with people you can constantly learn from. You’re trusted to get your work done your way while testing the limits of what’s possible and what’s next. We work hard to provide a culture where everyone feels supported, and our employees feel it—their votes helped us become one of the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hudl.com/blog/hudl-2026-top-100-inspiring-workplaces?utm_medium=internal&amp;amp;utm_source=job-ad&amp;amp;utm_campaign=26_NA_talent_job-ad&amp;amp;utm_content=1org_learn-more_blog-link_learn-more_2blog_organic_3ctw&quot;&gt;Top 100 Inspiring Workplaces&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We think of ourselves as the team behind the team, supporting the lifelong impact sports can have: the lessons in teamwork and dedication; the influence of inspiring coaches; and the opportunities to reach new heights. That’s why we help teams from all over the world see their game differently. Our products make it easier for coaches and athletes at any level to capture video, analyze data, share highlights and more.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ready to join us?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;padding: 56.25% 0 0 0; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;iframe style=&quot;position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://player.vimeo.com/video/1095624224?h=9e8cdc9dbe&amp;amp;badge=0&amp;amp;autopause=0&amp;amp;player_id=0&amp;amp;app_id=58479&quot; width=&quot;&quot; height=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re hiring a Senior Manager, HR Operations to lead our HR Operations function across Europe, Asia and LATAM. In this role, you&#39;ll translate global HR strategy into scalable programs, policies and service delivery standards while serving as a trusted advisor on complex governance and risk management across multiple international regions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Manager, HR Operations, you&#39;ll:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive strategy and advisory.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll shape the roadmap for international HR operations, aligning global policy with local needs while acting as a trusted advisor to senior leaders across the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead governance and compliance.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll manage end-to-end compliance across employment contracts, the employee lifecycle, global mobility, benefits, payroll and health and safety protocols across multiple countries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optimize processes.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll leverage automation and AI to scale operational efficiency, manage vendor relationships and execute key initiatives like policy overhauls or M&amp;amp;A integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop team talent.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll directly manage our HR Operations Manager and coach the broader regional team, setting service-level standards and using metrics to showcase operational impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Location&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Time spent collaborating with your teammates in-office will be a regular part of how you work. We&#39;re currently considering applicants within commuting distance of London or Barcelona. You&#39;ll be expected to work more days in-office than remote, but will have the freedom to coordinate your specific in-office schedule with your team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Must-Haves&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experienced manager.&lt;/strong&gt; You bring 10+ years of HR operations experience, including at least five years managing teams in a global environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International compliance expertise.&lt;/strong&gt; You have deep working knowledge of employment law, payroll, benefits and compliance across multiple countries, with strong experience in European regions like the U.K., Spain, Italy and the Netherlands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI fluent.&lt;/strong&gt; You have proven experience leveraging AI tools to optimize operations and improve workflow efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process builder.&lt;/strong&gt; You excel at creating scalable, automated processes across complex regulatory landscapes while balancing hands-on execution with long-term strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional collaborator.&lt;/strong&gt; You build strong partnerships with Legal, Finance and IT, comfortably managing vendor negotiations and influencing senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Nice-to-Haves&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Multilingual.&lt;/strong&gt; Conversational or fluent Spanish skills are a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Certified professional.&lt;/strong&gt; SHRM-SCP, GPHR or equivalent certifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced degree.&lt;/strong&gt; Master&#39;s degree in HR, Business or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our Role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion work-life harmony&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. We&#39;ll give you the flexibility you need in your work life (e.g., flexible vacation time above any required statutory leave, company-wide holidays and timeout (meeting-free) days, remote work options and more) so you can enjoy your personal life too.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Guarantee autonomy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. We have an open, honest culture and we trust our people from day one. Your team will support you, but you&#39;ll own your work and have the agency to try new ideas.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Encourage career growth. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re lifelong learners who encourage professional development. We&#39;ll give you tons of resources and opportunities to keep growing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Provide an environment to help you succeed&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. We&#39;ve invested in our offices, designing incredible spaces with our employees in mind. But whether you&#39;re at the office or working remotely, we&#39;ll provide you the tech you need to do your best work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support your wellbeing. &lt;/strong&gt;Depending on location, we offer medical and retirement benefits for employees—but no matter where you&#39;re located, we have resources like our Employee Assistance Program and employee resource groups to support your mental health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion work-life harmony.&lt;/strong&gt; We&#39;ll give you the flexibility you need in your work life (e.g., flexible vacation time, company-wide holidays and more) so you can enjoy your personal life too. Plus, every five years, we give you a paid sabbatical to unplug and recharge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Guarantee autonomy.&lt;/strong&gt; We have an open, honest culture and we trust our people from day one. Your team will support you, but you&#39;ll own your work and have the agency to try new ideas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Encourage career growth.&lt;/strong&gt; We&#39;re lifelong learners who encourage professional development. We&#39;ll give you tons of resources and opportunities to keep growing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Provide an environment to help you succeed.&lt;/strong&gt; We&#39;re always investing in our offices, designing incredible spaces with our employees in mind. But whether you&#39;re at the office or working remotely, we&#39;ll provide you the tech stack and hardware to do your best work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Take care of your mental and physical health.&lt;/strong&gt; Medical plans tailored for you and your family—including vision, dental, and fertility benefits—and stay supported with our EAP and Employee Resource Groups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribute to your 401(K).&lt;/strong&gt; Yep, that&#39;s free money. We&#39;ll match up to 4% of your own contribution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Compensation&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The base salary range for this role is displayed below—&lt;strong&gt;starting salaries will typically fall near the middle of this range.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We make compensation decisions based on an individual&#39;s experience, skills and education in line with our internal pay equity practices.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will also be eligible for a long-term incentive (LTI) award. Any bonuses awarded are based on individual and company performance paid at Hudl&#39;s discretion.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£75,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£125,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hudl.com/jobs/hudl-applicant-and-candidate-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Hudl Applicant and Candidate Privacy Policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/hudl/senior-manager-hr-operations-london-81451","tags":["People Ops"],"job_types":[],"location":"London","created_at":1792205720},{"slug":"gtm-recruiter-emea-paris-493096","company_name":"Notion","title":"GTM Recruiter, EMEA","description":"<h1>Who We Are</h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">Notion is the collaborative AI workspace where teams and agents <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vkpYpWfEK5s">think together</a>. We're building one place where your knowledge, projects, meetings, and AI tools live side by side, so work is faster, clearer, and less fragmented. Millions of individuals, small teams, and large companies run their work on Notion.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Notinos (our employees) are customer zero in bringing this future of work to life. We care about craft, building things that last, and the belief that great work is still fundamentally human. Our goal isn’t to ship the next feature. Each and every team of Notinos is working to set the standard for how humans work together in the AI era. From building a business’s system of record to making and managing AI agents to automating away the busy work, we care deeply about giving our customers more time for their life’s work.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1>About the Role:</h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">The Notion EMEA Recruiting team acts as trusted business partners who craft a thorough, inclusive, and curated interviewing experience. We believe hiring exceptional talent, at the right time, is the best path forward to achieve our company’s ambitious goals.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We’re looking for a Go-to-Market Recruiter to support our growth across key Go-to-Market (GTM) teams in EMEA, with an emphasis on Sales. In this role, you'll help shape our recruiting strategy, manage full-cycle hiring efforts, and ensure a delightful yet rigorous hiring process.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">This role will be based in Paris. We work from our offices on Mondays, Tuesdays and Thursdays (our Anchor Days) because we do our best thinking and building together in person. We’re looking for someone who’s excited to work alongside the team during those days. </p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1>What You'll Achieve:</h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Serve as a trusted recruiting partner to leaders across the GTM org, owning the full recruiting lifecycle from sourcing through successful close</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Design and implement creative sourcing strategies to attract diverse top talent across EMEA markets</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ensure scalable and structured hiring plans with consistent evaluation processes while creating thoughtful candidate experiences</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partner with cross-functional teams including Total Rewards, People Operations, and People Partners to drive holistic talent strategies</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Leverage AI tools, to innovate recruiting processes and provide data-driven insights on market conditions</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Champion and scale best practices while thoughtfully adapting for regional nuances</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1>Skills You'll Need to Bring: </h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">5+ years of full-cycle recruiting experience in high-growth, technical, GTM functions</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Fluency in French and English</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Proven track record of identifying, qualifying, and closing exceptional talent across various levels</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience coaching and advising hiring managers through our recruiting process while keeping talent density as a priority</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ability to build diverse candidate pipelines and guide hiring managers in creating inclusive teams</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Outstanding communication, attention to detail, and interpersonal skills with a commitment to delivering high-quality recruiting experiences</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ability to thrive in fast-paced, dynamic environments</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1>Nice to Haves:</h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Passionate about leveraging technology and AI to transform recruiting processes</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Notion is committed to providing highly competitive cash compensation, equity, and benefits. The compensation offered for this role will be based on multiple factors such as location, the role's scope and complexity, and the candidate's experience and expertise, and may vary from the range provided below. The estimated range for total on target earnings (including base salary and on target incentive pay) for this role is €98,000-€109,000 per year.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">By clicking “Submit Application”, I understand and agree that Notion and its affiliates and subsidiaries will collect and process my information in accordance with Notion’s <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://notion.notion.site/Notion-Global-Recruiting-Privacy-Policy-fc3eb4e829354a26a2bb6fd5e289b550"><u>Global Recruiting Privacy Policy</u></a><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://dev.notion.so/a3ce416456924276a59de91bca740028?pvs=21"><u>.</u></a></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">#LI-Onsite</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1>A Note on AI</h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">You don’t need deep AI expertise for every role, but we do expect every Notino to be intellectually curious, drawn to tinkering and discovery, and excited to use AI as a real collaborator in their work. For some roles, AI fluency is a core requirement — when that’s the case, we'll say so explicitly in the qualifications. People who thrive here don’t treat AI as a novelty. They use it to think better, and make their work easier for others to build on.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1>Equal Opportunity &amp; Accommodations</h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">We hire talented people from a wide range of backgrounds. If you’re excited about this role but don’t meet every bullet, we still encourage you to apply. Notion is an equal opportunity employer and does not discriminate on the basis of any legally protected characteristic. Consistent with applicable law, we will consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records. Notion provides reasonable accommodations during the application process; if you need one, please let your recruiter know.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Notion is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate in hiring or any employment decision based on race, color, religion, national origin, age, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), marital status, ancestry, physical or mental disability, genetic information, veteran status, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, or other applicable legally protected characteristic. Notion considers qualified applicants with criminal histories, consistent with applicable federal, state and local law. Notion is also committed to providing reasonabl