&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;662&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Privacy and AI Guidelines:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;662&quot;&gt;Any information you submit to Datadog as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Datadog’s&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Applicant and Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. For information on our AI policy, please visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/interviewing-at-datadog-ai-guidelines/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Interviewing at Datadog AI Guidelines&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/datadog/senior-manager-product-design-security-paris-414722","tags":["Product Design"],"job_types":[],"location":"Paris","created_at":1792216516},{"slug":"turkey-content-specialist-paris-50135","company_name":"Amo","title":"Turkey Content Specialist","description":"<h1><strong>Role Overview</strong></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">We're looking for an ambitious, growth-obsessed Content Specialist who basically thinks in TikToks. Someone who gets fired up by great content, knows what's trending before it trends, and wants to take Bump to #1 on the App Store in Turkey (and keep it there).</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You'll be the person bringing internet culture from Turkey into the heart of our Paris office, creating content, leading creators, testing wild ideas, breaking things (in a good way), and helping us build Bump into a must-have app.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">If that sounds like your dream job, keep reading.<br /><br /></p><h1><strong>You are:</strong></h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ambitious, driven, and wildly creative.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A natural storyteller who knows exactly why one video flops and another takes off.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Someone who spends more time on TikTok than you'd ever admit publicly.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Comfortable giving creators feedback that actually makes their content better.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Deeply tuned into Turkish memes, humour, and online culture.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Fluent in Turkish and lived in Turkey.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Excited to work onsite in Paris, with a fast-moving team.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Scrappy, energetic, experimental, you love trying 10 ideas to find the 1 that blows up, yet rigorous and detail oriented.<br /><br /></p></li></ul><h1><strong>What You’ll Do:</strong></h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Grow Bump in Turkey (yep, you'll actually own this).</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lead all content + creator efforts for the Turkish market.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Make high-performing TikToks, Reels, and UGC-style ads that people actually want to watch.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build and manage a pipeline of Turkish creators.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Run influencer campaigns with top Turkish creators and micro-influencers.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work closely with paid marketing to turn great content into great performance.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Jump on trends before they hit the For You Page.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Write briefs, give notes, and help external creators shine.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Collaborate daily in our Paris office with growth, distribution, and product.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Join brainstorms, test ideas fast, and help shape the creative direction of Bump.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Support launches, events, and Turkey-focused activations.<br /><br /></p></li></ul><h1><strong>Requirements:</strong></h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">1–5+ years making short-form content (brand, agency, influencer, or creator, we care more about your work than your title).</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience making content for ads (UGC especially).</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience managing creators or giving creative feedback.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Deep knowledge of TikTok/IG trends and the Turkish creator landscape.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Turkish language and English language proficiency.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience living in Turkey.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Must be willing to work in person in Paris.<br /><br /></p></li></ul><h1><strong>Why Join Bump?</strong></h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work in Paris with an ambitious, high-energy team that moves fast.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own the entire Turkish market for one of the world's fastest-growing consumer apps.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Make content seen by millions and watch your work directly drive growth.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Do the kind of creative work most companies would never let you try.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build a content engine from scratch and shape how Bump shows up in Turkey.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">We test fast, learn fast, and celebrate wins properly.</p></li></ul><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/amo/turkey-content-specialist-paris-50135","tags":["Distribution"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Paris","created_at":1792215634},{"slug":"forward-deployed-banker-paris-287923","company_name":"Rogo","title":"Forward Deployed Banker, Paris","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Why Rogo</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Our mission is to transform global finance by empowering professionals at the world's top investment banks, private equity funds, and investment firms with AI that delivers unparalleled speed, accuracy, and insight. We're not just improving financial workflows; we're redefining them.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">This is a unique opportunity to join a generational company driving transformation in one of the most important industries in the world. With a rapidly growing, global client base, proven product-market fit, and backing from world-class investors, we are scaling quickly and defining a new category of enterprise AI.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Our team is sharp, motivated, and deeply committed to Rogo’s mission. We take ownership of complex problems and stay relentlessly focused on our users. If you thrive in a fast-paced environment, demand excellence, and want to help build the future of finance, we invite you to join us.</p><h2><strong>What you'll do</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Be Rogo's investment banking expert in the room:</strong> Design and lead tailored demos of Rogo's platform, translating AI capabilities into real impact across core banking workflows — company research, financial modeling, valuation, M&amp;A advisory, capital markets, and client deliverables. In every sales cycle, you'll paint the vision of what "fully deployed" looks like for each bank: Rogo as core to how their teams research, pitch, and execute.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Work cross-functionally:</strong> Partner directly with Sales, Product, and Engineering to drive our GTM motion and continuously improve the product. You are the voice of the prospective customer — bringing what the market is asking for, and firsthand investment banking expertise, into our product development philosophy.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Be the trusted expert in the sales cycle:</strong> As a domain and GTM leader in the earliest conversations with our future customers, you'll understand and anticipate how bankers work — building trusted, consultative relationships that establish Rogo's credibility, shape the evaluation, and win the deal.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Scope and run proof-of-value:</strong> Design proof-of-value exercises that justify the deal — mapping Rogo's capabilities to each bank's specific coverage groups, product areas, and deal workflows so that the use cases feel bespoke to their firm. You'll define success criteria with the prospect up front, tie them to business outcomes their leadership cares about, and build the evidence that turns an evaluation into a commitment.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Elevate our GTM motion:</strong> Develop best-in-class demo environments, banking use cases, and enablement materials that showcase how Rogo fits into real investment banking workflows and help the broader team win more business.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Influence product direction:</strong> Translate customer feedback, banking workflows, and market trends into actionable insights that sharpen the platform and strengthen our competitive advantage.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>What you'll bring</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">2+ years of investment banking experience at a top-tier investment bank.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong command of core banking workflows — financial modeling, valuation, M&amp;A, capital markets, due diligence, and client presentations.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Executive presence and the ability to build credibility with senior bankers and financial services leaders, from analysts up through MDs and Group Heads.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Outstanding communication and presentation skills, whether leading a polished product demo or explaining complex financial concepts on the fly.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">The ability to connect a prospect's specific business problems to Rogo's solutions and explain them to both technical and non-technical audiences.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A structured, outcome-oriented approach: comfort defining success criteria, scoping evaluations, and building the business case that gets a deal over the line.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A genuine curiosity about AI and conviction about how it will reshape investment banking.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Bachelor's degree or above.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Bilingual in English and French, with excellent written and verbal communication skills in both. </p></li></ul><h2><strong>Even better...</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience working directly with clients or leading live deal execution alongside senior bankers and executives.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience partnering with Product or Engineering, translating customer requirements and banking workflows into product improvements.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Previous experience in B2B SaaS, fintech, or AI, particularly in customer-facing or solutions-oriented roles.</p></li></ul><h2><strong>Who You Are</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>You thrive in fast-paced environments. </strong>You are high-intensity and care a lot about what you do, and you're ecstatic to work at a startup. </p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>You are ambitious. </strong>You have fun solving problems that others think are impossible. </p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>You are curious.</strong>  You find joy in learning about AI, technology, and finance.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>You are an owner.</strong> You are autonomous, self-directed, and comfortable working with ambiguity.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>You are collaborative, organized, thoughtful, and kind</strong>.</p></li></ul><h2><strong>Why Join Rogo?</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Up and to the right:</strong> Rogo has strong product adoption with the world's leading financial institutions, and we are still early. The upside is enormous.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Extraordinary team:</strong> we take talent density seriously. You'll do the best work of your career alongside some of the sharpest people in AI and finance.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>A one-of-one problem:</strong> bringing AI to the core of how Wall Street works is one of the most ambitious, technically demanding, and consequential problems today. There is nowhere else you can work on it at this scale.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Real ownership</strong>: You'll own real surface area and watch the world's most sophisticated users rely on your work.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Always at the frontier: </strong>we work at the edge of what the best models can do and turn it into products people trust. If you're obsessed with AI, this is where it's happening.</p></li></ul><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/rogo/forward-deployed-banker-paris-287923","tags":["Strategic Opportunities"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Paris","created_at":1792215631},{"slug":"customer-enablement-specialist-12-month-ftc-paris-paris-279768","company_name":"Kaluza","title":"Customer Enablement Specialist (12 month FTC)","description":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job title: Customer Enablement Specialist (12 Month Fixed-Term)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: Paris&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary: €42,400 - €53,000&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team: Client Delivery EMEA&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting To: Operating Model Design Lead&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;This role is based in Paris, France and requires an existing right to work in the EU.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At this time, we are not able to offer visa sponsorship for this role. We are committed to building a diverse, global team and our sponsorship policy is evaluated on a role-by-role basis. We encourage you to keep an eye on our careers site to stay informed about future opportunities where we are able to offer visa sponsorship.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please submit your application in English.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Kaluza is the Energy Intelligence Platform, turning energy complexity into seamless coordination. We help energy companies overcome today&#39;s challenges while accelerating the shift to a clean, electrified future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our platform orchestrates millions of real-time decisions across homes, devices, markets and grids. By combining predictive algorithms with human-centred design, Kaluza makes clean energy dependable, affordable and adaptive to everyday life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With teams across Europe, Asia and Australia, and a joint venture with Mitsubishi Corporation in Japan, we power leading companies including OVO, AGL and ENGIE, as well as innovators like Volvo and Volkswagen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;What will I be doing?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will be a key driver of our mission to reimagine energy and make net-zero a reality for everyone. As a &lt;strong&gt;Customer Enablement Specialist&lt;/strong&gt;, you will be the bridge between our innovative technology and the people who use it. You will empower our clients, partners, and colleagues in French-speaking markets to not only understand our platform but to master it - including the AI-powered capabilities we are continuously building and rolling out. Your work will directly accelerate Kaluza&#39;s growth by ensuring our users are confident, capable, and ready to support the energy transition.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Training &amp;amp; Programme Partnership:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a trusted advisor to our clients, partners, and internal teams, performing deep learning needs analysis to understand their unique operational challenges. You&#39;ll manage your workstream with genuine project and programme management discipline - planning, sequencing and tracking delivery within complex, multi-stakeholder client programmes, ideally drawing on agile ways of working to stay responsive as scope evolves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Content Creation &amp;amp; Delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; You will be the master of making the complex simple. You&#39;ll create high-quality, engaging training materials in both &lt;strong&gt;French&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;English&lt;/strong&gt;, including interactive workshops, e-learning modules, and quick reference guides - translating not just today&#39;s platform, but AI features and products still in development, into training that&#39;s ready the moment they go live. You&#39;ll deliver these sessions virtually and in-person, inspiring your audience and building their confidence with every interaction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Driving Adoption &amp;amp; Impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Your role is to accelerate the adoption of the Kaluza platform. You will provide post-training support and coaching, monitor the effectiveness of your programmes, and continuously iterate based on feedback and performance metrics. You&#39;ll ensure our training leads to real-world, positive change for our users and the energy industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;About You&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ideally you’ll have/be&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bilingual Fluency, to a high standard:&lt;/strong&gt; You are fluent in both &lt;strong&gt;French&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;English&lt;/strong&gt;, with outstanding written and spoken communication skills - essential for day-to-day stakeholder management across multiple countries, up to and including executive level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational &amp;amp; Technical SaaS Training Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; A proven track record designing and delivering training in a SaaS or technology environment, ideally with hands-on experience of operational or technical instructional training rather than generalist L&amp;amp;D delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project &amp;amp; Programme Management Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong project and/or programme management experience gained within complex, multi-stakeholder environments; experience of agile delivery is a strong advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrable experience gained within an operational environment - energy sector operations and/or contact centre settings are especially valued - giving you a first-hand understanding of the pressures and workflows your training needs to support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrable experience building, productionalising, or delivering training on AI features and products while they are still in development, and genuine confidence working with AI tools as part of your own everyday practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Simplification Master:&lt;/strong&gt; You possess a natural ability to take complex technical and business concepts and translate them into clear, engaging, and practical learning materials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engaging Facilitator:&lt;/strong&gt; You are a confident and dynamic presenter, able to captivate diverse audiences and create a fun, interactive learning environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative &amp;amp; Proactive:&lt;/strong&gt; You are a team player who builds strong relationships and is proactive in identifying opportunities to support others and drive continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will set you apart&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Energy Sector Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; A practical background in energy utility operations or decarbonisation technologies, beyond the operational experience above, that lets you connect training directly to the real-world challenges our clients face.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven Training Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; A demonstrated track record of scaling training programmes and an ability to think strategically about how to build and expand a learning culture across an international organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Where you&#39;ll work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer flexible working, with an expectation of 3 days a week in the office. This gives us the best of both: real time together to collaborate and build relationships, with the flexibility to work in the way that suits you best the rest of the week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Kaluza Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here at Kaluza we have five core values that guide us as a business:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Play to win, Solve the real problem, Build trust every day, Own the outcome, Go further together.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial &amp;amp; Insurance:&lt;/strong&gt; Discretionary bonus, Alan Mutuelle Health Insurance, x3 Life &amp;amp; Death insurance (Prévoyance) via Alan, and standard Sécurité Sociale contributions (pension, family allowance, unemployment insurance)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Allowances:&lt;/strong&gt; 50% commuting expense reimbursement, €200 Home Working Allowance, and €150 Learning Fund&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time Off &amp;amp; Flexibility:&lt;/strong&gt; 25 days holiday + bank holidays + RTT days, Moments That Matter Leave, Compassionate Leave, two paid Volunteering Days, Flexible Working, and Career Break eligibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We want the best people&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re keen to meet people from all walks of life — our view is that the more inclusive we are, the better our work will be. We want to build teams which represent a variety of experiences, perspectives and skills, and we recognise talent on the basis of merit and potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We understand some people may not apply for jobs unless they tick every box. But if you&#39;re excited about joining us and think you have some of what we&#39;re looking for, even if you&#39;re not 100% sure, we&#39;d still love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more about working in &lt;a href=&quot;http://kaluza.com&quot;&gt;Kaluza&lt;/a&gt; on our &lt;a href=&quot;https://kaluza-dev.webflow.io/careers&quot;&gt;careers page&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/kaluza/&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You can also find our Applicant Data Protection Policy &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.kaluza.com/applicant-data-protection-notice&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/kaluza/customer-enablement-specialist-12-month-ftc-paris-paris-279768","tags":["Client Delivery"],"job_types":[],"location":"Paris, Paris","created_at":1792205722},{"slug":"gtm-strategy-analyst-paris-347536","company_name":"Meetdavis","title":"GTM & Strategy Analyst","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>TL;DR: </strong>We are looking for a gap-year or final-year student to work alongside the leadership team on Davis's <strong>go-to-market, strategy and growth</strong>.</p><h1><br /><strong>About Davis</strong></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">Davis is an AI-native real estate company accelerating early-stage development and architectural design. Today developers coordinate four to five fragmented stakeholders over weeks or months. Soon they will need only one: Davis.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We turn every input that shapes a development decision into decision-ready outputs: investor-grade feasibility studies, investment analysis, and architect-certified designs, delivered in days. Every stage pairs our proprietary AI systems with expert review, so velocity never comes at the cost of reliability.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We closed a <strong>$5.5M pre-seed</strong> co-led by <strong>Heartcore Capital</strong> and <strong>Balderton Capital</strong>, with Yellow, Evantic and Entrepreneur First, alongside angels from the founding teams of Spacemaker, Black Forest Labs, Hugging Face, Supabase, Cleo and Spore Bio. We already work with leading developers and expect to support hundreds of projects over the coming year, deepening our research, our hiring, and our coverage of the development process end to end.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1><strong>The role</strong></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">The role is cross-functional. You work directly with the whole team: the CEO and the Real Estate Partner as much as the tech teams.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Together with them, you take part in decisions on company strategy, client acquisition and relationships, and product improvement. Your analyses form the basis for these decisions.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Client relationships and deliverables</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Contribute to studies for our developer and investor clients, from data analysis to final formatting.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Incorporate client feedback and improve deliverable quality from one version to the next.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Gather client needs and feedback, then turn them into concrete proposals to shape the offer and improve the product.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><br /><strong>Product improvement</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Turn recurring work methods into automated tools and processes, with the tech teams.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Formalise the methods and quality standards these tools reproduce.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Test these tools on real cases and suggest improvements.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Support their adoption by the team: documentation, onboarding, user feedback.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Go-to-market and client acquisition</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Define the priority client segments and the decision-makers to approach.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build the target account list and identify entry points and partnerships.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Prepare prospecting materials and key meetings.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Strategy and planning</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Maintain the business plan and prepare the analyses that inform leadership decisions, including with investors.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1><strong>Profile</strong></h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Education</strong>: student at a top business or engineering school, on a gap year or in your final year.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Experience</strong>: a first internship in strategy consulting, investment banking, growth/VC, a leading real estate investment fund or a start-up.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Key skills</strong>: strong <strong>synthesis and presentation skills</strong>, a real appetite for AI tools and a genuine interest in the real estate sector.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h3><strong><u>Analytical skills</u></strong></h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ability to study a market (size, dynamics, players, prices, demand), structure it, segment targets and build a clear, verifiable model.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ability to structure a client presentation and deliver it.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Rigour and attention to detail in analysis.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong writing skills, in French and English.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h3><strong><u>Additional skills</u></strong></h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong intellectual curiosity, with an appetite for real estate and for AI tools.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Autonomy and the ability to get up to speed quickly on new topics.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ease in dealing with leadership, clients and partners.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Enjoys working with tech teams. Knowledge of real estate is a plus.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>Why join Davis?</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will work closely with the leadership team, with a full view of strategy, business development, clients and product.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will have broad autonomy and a direct impact on company decisions.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will learn to use AI as an everyday productivity lever, on high-stakes topics.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>Package</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">6-month full-time internship</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Offices in Paris 75002</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Meal vouchers</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">50% of public transport costs covered</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1><strong>More information about Davis, the team and the market we’re going after:</strong></h1><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><h2><strong>Team</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">Mehdi (Co-founder &amp; CEO) grew up in a family of architects and has lived this problem firsthand. He's a repeat founder who <strong>bootstrapped his first startup at 20</strong>, and graduated from Sciences Po and HEC Paris. Amine (Co-founder &amp; CTO) is an AI researcher from <strong>École Polytechnique</strong> who worked extensively on discrete diffusion and <strong>turned down a PhD with Google DeepMind</strong> to build Davis. They started working together in July 2025 at Entrepreneur First's first European residency, a two-month lock-in in a German castle.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Today we're <strong>a team of 12</strong>: technical profiles from Polytechnique, ENS and INRIA alongside architects and deep real estate expertise.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We're small with an <strong>extremely high bar</strong>. If you want to work deeply on hard problems and see your work reach clients within days, you're the one we need.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><h2><strong>Why we'll win</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">Real estate is a <strong>$13 trillion industry</strong> that technology has largely bypassed. The professional services that feed it (design, engineering, feasibility, permitting) represent hundreds of billions in spend that no one has seriously automated.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Proptech spent the last decade selling <strong>SaaS</strong> on the edges of these workflows. It didn't work, for two reasons: no professional wants another tool to learn, and no tool can automate work that runs on expert judgment. Davis makes a different bet. <strong>We don't sell tools, we sell the work</strong>: AI-generated, expert-validated, delivered in days instead of weeks. Every project compounds our data advantage across typologies, geographies and regulatory contexts.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h3><strong>We care about who you are, not just what's on your CV.</strong></h3><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>If you're drawn to what we're building but don't meet every requirement, we still want to hear from you. Studies show that women in particular tend to apply only when they meet 100% of the criteria. If that's you, please don't let that hold you back. We'd love to receive your application.</em></p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/meetdavis/gtm-strategy-analyst-paris-347536","tags":["Business & Operations"],"job_types":["Intern"],"location":"Paris","created_at":1792204837},{"slug":"staff-mechanical-engineer-paris-226449","company_name":"Ledger","title":"Staff Mechanical Engineer","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>About Ledger</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We’re a team of experts pushing the limits of what’s possible, united by our common goal to unlock true freedom through digital ownership, making technology accessible for all. We believe in a world where users, creators and enterprises manage their value with ownership and freedom. Our curiosity drives us to innovate, empowering individuals on a global scale. We believe change is constant and our team moves forward as one, with a culture of problem-solving where every employee is empowered and supported to challenge tradition and create solutions. Our mission is simple: to make self-custody accessible and give people the keys to their own financial futures. If you want to make a true impact, we want you to join us at Ledger.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">At Ledger, we’re proud to be the global platform for digital assets and Web3, with over 20% of the world’s crypto assets secured through our Ledger devices. With our headquarters in Paris, and offices in Vierzon, Grenoble, Montpellier, London, Portland, Geneva, Zurich and Central Singapore, we have a team of around 600 professionals developing a variety of products and services to enable individuals and companies to securely buy, store, swap, grow and manage crypto assets – including the Ledger hardware wallets line with more than 7.5 millions units already sold in 200 countries.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">The Ledger Devices team is growing. We are taking secure hardware products for Web3 to the next level. Come be part of a very ambitious roadmap at the most respected brand in the industry. We are looking for a senior Mechanical Engineering Lead to help us drive the design of our next generations of products.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Reporting to the head of engineering, you will be responsible for all aspects of the Mechanical architecture.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">What you will do:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lead the Mechanical design / architecture choices.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Drive complex integrations of components and structure.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own the CAD and integrate all constraints from antenna, PCBA, connectors, …etc.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Define and Validate reliability testing specifications.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Drive molds and Tooling processes.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own exec relationships with key suppliers.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lead/build a team, teach best practices, and develop junior colleagues.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Communicate with the extended hardware and firmware team members to ensure smooth program delivery.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Drive DFM efforts, and Contract Manufacturer delivery of the chosen design.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lead the CMF definition of Ledger devices, at the intersection of product vision, industrial design requirements and manufacturing constraints.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Prototype and debug devices in the lab, and perform device teardowns.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Present clearly the technical choices and trade offs to the leadership team.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">What we are looking for:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">7+ years of experience in the consumer electronics industry, or in an industry where the skillset transfers well (e.g. Medical devices, Wearables, Telecom, IoT…etc.)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Track record shipping devices to market successfully</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience in kicking off tools and processes at scale.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong CAD skills in SolidWorks (preferred) or equivalent (e.g. Creo, Onshape), with a good grasp of GD&amp;T.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Proficient in tolerance analysis (arithmetic &amp; statistical), and able to plan, conduct and review statistical process control (SPC) studies.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A practical, hands-on engineer, comfortable troubleshooting directly in the lab and on the line. A natural leader that can develop and inspire others.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ability to thrive in a fast-paced environment.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Willingness to deal with uncertainty and change.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Curiosity about the crypto / blockchain industry a big plus</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">At Ledger, we are dedicated to continually investing in our employees which is why we offer more than just salaries; we provide comprehensive compensation packages that include a wide range of benefits. Here are some of the benefits you can look forward to:<strong> </strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Flexible work options - </strong>Our hybrid policy allows employees to work from home up to 3 times per week</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Health &amp; Wellness support - </strong>Health and Life Insurance.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Financial growth opportunities - </strong>Employees can become shareholders in Ledger as well as other financial benefits depending on your country of work.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Commuter allowance - </strong>Ledger offers a commuter allowance to contribute to your preferred means of transportation.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Learning &amp; Development </strong>- A comprehensive suite of training solutions providing a personalised learning experience for every employee.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">For regionally specific benefits, your Talent Acquisition contact will be able to provide you with more information.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>We’re committed to building an inclusive hiring process. If you need any adjustments or accommodations, just let us know, we’ll do our best to support you.</em></p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/ledger/staff-mechanical-engineer-paris-226449","tags":["Tech"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Paris, France","created_at":1792204835},{"slug":"digital-manager-paris-65716","company_name":"Hcompany","title":"Digital Manager","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>About H:</strong> </p><p style="min-height:1.5em">H Company is a next-generation AI research and product company pioneering the future of autonomous, agentic AI. Founded to build intelligence that acts, H Company is creating the foundational infrastructure for autonomous AI systems that drive real-world outcomes across industries.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>The Role</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">Large enterprises find H through a referral, an event or a headline, and then they land on our website. Today that moment converts too little, and we can't fully measure it. Your mission is to make our website and online channels the first source of qualified enterprise pipeline for H, worldwide</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will own H's online engine, as a senior individual contributor in the Growth pillar of our marketing strategy, alongside Brand and Product Marketing. You'll lead the redesign of our website with a web agency, own its performance and conversion, build our organic visibility on search engines and in AI answers (SEO and GEO), and steer our paid agency on LinkedIn, Google and other channels.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Your focus is the enterprise funnel: C-level and IT decision-makers in large accounts, demo requests, and long sales cycles run with our Sales and FDE teams. Every choice you make is judged on one question: does it create qualified pipeline?</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You'll work hand in hand with the Brand Lead (identity), the Content Manager (words), Sales and RevOps (HubSpot), and our external web and paid agencies.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>What You'll Do</h2><h3>Lead the website redesign (Foundations)</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own the redesign of <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="http://h.company">h.company</a> end to end: brief, select and steer a web agency, from architecture and UX to build, launch and iteration.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Set the site's technical standards: CMS, performance, accessibility, security, and a multi-market setup (France, UK, US) that scales.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own tracking, analytics and attribution, with a clean integration into HubSpot, so every visit, campaign and demo request can be traced to pipeline.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Decide the platform, architecture and conversion choices; the Brand Lead owns identity, the Content Manager owns copy.</p></li></ul><h3>Turn visitors into pipeline (Conversion)</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Design the journeys that turn enterprise visitors into qualified demo requests, by persona (C-level, IT and business leaders) and by use case.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Run a continuous testing roadmap (A/B tests, landing pages, forms,