&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Factures fournisseurs :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collecter les factures et informations manquantes auprès des fournisseurs et équipes métiers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contrôler les factures dès leur réception,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Valider ces dernières auprès des différentes équipes,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Saisir les factures fournisseurs dans le logiciel Sage,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mettre à jour et contrôler les codes analytiques des écritures comptables&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyser les comptes fournisseurs (lettrages, justifications des soldes)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note de Frais :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contrôler et valider les notes de frais,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Les intégrer dans Sage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Divers :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participer à l’amélioration des outils de gestion (Yooz, Sage 1000, Reporting BI…)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Réaliser diverses tâches administratives,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aider à la préparation de la clôture semestrielle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;La variété des diverses tâches qui vous seront attribuées vous permettra d&#39;enrichir vos connaissances et de contribuer à l’amélioration de notre service&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profil :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous préparez un diplôme dans le domaine de la gestion, comptabilité, contrôle, audit, finance et&amp;nbsp; vous justifiez idéalement d’une première expérience professionnelle (en stage par exemple) sur un poste similaire.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous maîtrisez les techniques comptables et les logiciels informatiques du métier (Idéalement Sage, le pack office).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organisé, enthousiaste, vous êtes reconnu(e) pour votre énergie, votre autonomie et votre sens de responsabilité.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez l’esprit d’équipe et vous êtes à l’aise en communication, tant orale qu’écrite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salaire : &lt;/strong&gt;1200€ brut / mois&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Processus de Recrutement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entretien RH&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entretien avec le Responsable comptable France&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entretien DAF France&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Chez Artefact, nous recrutons nos collaborateurs uniquement en fonction de nos besoins et des qualités propres de chaque candidat. Nous assurons le développement de leurs compétences professionnelles et de leurs responsabilités sans discrimination d’aucune sorte, notamment de croyances, de genre, d’âge, de situation d&#39;handicap, d’origine ethnique, d’orientation sexuelle, d’appartenance à une organisation politique, religieuse, syndicale ou à une minorité.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come join us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/artefactjobs/accounting-intern-paris-9th-arrondissement-of-paris-75009-paris-231010","tags":["Corporate Functions"],"job_types":[],"location":"9th arrondissement of Paris, 75009, Paris","created_at":1792184142},{"slug":"senior-product-manager-measurement-reporting-paris-334847","company_name":"Vibe","title":"Senior Product Manager - Measurement & Reporting","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em">Streaming TV is no longer just a brand awareness channel. It’s becoming a core part of the performance marketing mix, alongside search and social. <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="http://Vibe.co">Vibe.co</a> is building the platform that makes TV work like the rest of the acquisition stack: targeted, measurable, and optimized for results.<br /><br /><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="http://Vibe.co">Vibe.co</a> is an <strong>Audience First Streaming TV Advertising platform</strong> that gives marketers the tools to reach the right audiences, optimize campaigns in real time, and understand what’s actually driving business outcomes. With hyper-targeted segmentation, AI-powered recommendations, real-time optimization, and incrementality measurement, Vibe brings the precision and accountability of digital advertising to the biggest screen in the house.<br /><br />Today, more than 12,000 brands use <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="http://Vibe.co">Vibe.co</a> to reach 120 million+ households. And in August 2026, <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="http://Vibe.co">Vibe.co</a> became a Walmart company, opening up a new chapter for the business and the industry. With Walmart’s first-party data and purchase signals now part of the Vibe platform, advertisers can connect TV advertising to real-world transactions and measure the impact of CTV with a level of precision previously associated with platforms like Google and Meta.<br /><br /><strong>This is a unique moment to join Vibe.</strong> With Walmart’s scale, data, and reach behind us, we’re building the next generation of TV advertising and creating a more measurable, performance-driven future for the channel.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>About the Role</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You’ll own Measurement &amp; Reporting: the product surface where Vibe turns campaign delivery into proof. Performance is why clients pick Vibe. Trusted, actionable measurement is why they stay and scale with us.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Reporting to the VP of Product, you’ll own the strategy and roadmap for how Vibe explains and proves the impact of CTV advertising across every vertical. Your main focus will be ecom and CPG, with growing coverage of apps, local, and travel. The goal is to make CTV outcomes as trustworthy and actionable as search and social, so clients confidently move more budget to Vibe.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You’ll work daily with Data Science, Data Platform, Engineering, and our client-facing teams (CS, Sales, TAM). With Walmart’s purchase data now part of the platform, measurement is becoming one of Vibe’s biggest differentiators.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What You’ll Do</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Reporting &amp; Insight</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own advertiser-facing reporting, including dashboards, outcome metrics, and exports that make CTV performance clear to both technical and non-technical buyers.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Turn raw performance data into benchmarks and insights clients can grasp at a glance.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Attribution &amp; Incrementality</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Productize attribution and incrementality to a client-grade standard, not just an internal signal.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own integrations with the measurement tools clients already trust, such as MMPs, web/CAPI pixels, MMM, and third-party partners (e.g. Northbeam, Haus), so Vibe’s numbers hold up next to Meta and Google.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Guarantee data accuracy, transparent methodology, and defensible results.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Activation</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Translate measurement into clear recommendations and next actions that drive spend decisions.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Close the loop between proven outcomes and campaign optimization, powering the “more performance → more spend” flywheel.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partner with CS, Sales, and TAM to make measurement the core of how we retain and grow clients.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Use SQL and log-level data to validate methodologies, size opportunities, and prioritize by impact.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What You Need</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">5+ years in Product Management on performance AdTech, measurement/attribution, or analytics products.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong grasp of digital measurement (attribution models, incrementality and causal testing, MMM) and of why click-based models break for CTV.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Solid statistical literacy, including experimental design, holdouts, significance, and confidence intervals.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A track record of shipping client-facing reporting or insight products, and of making complex data simple and trustworthy for marketers.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Fluency with outcome KPIs across verticals and with the ecom/CPG performance stack.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Hands-on SQL and data exploration, and you’re comfortable in technical, data-intensive environments.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">The ability to bridge technical measurement and business/GTM stakeholders.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Why This Role</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You’ll own the product domain that decides whether clients trust their Vibe spend, and whether they scale it.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You’ll have a direct line to revenue, because measurement is Vibe’s main lever for retaining and growing clients.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You’ll shape how an entire category proves CTV as a performance channel.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You’ll have high autonomy and influence across functions, from data science to clients’ C-suite.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Our Values</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">At Vibe, we run on three values: Impact, Ambition, and Urgency. We tie every goal to a real business outcome, think 10x rather than settling for good enough, and move daily rather than waiting for perfect conditions.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You’ll thrive here if you own outcomes without needing direction, default to action, and hold yourself to results, not effort.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">This is a high-performance environment with high-performance rewards: you’ll work alongside people who push you, with real ownership over hard problems in a market that’s moving fast.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">If that sounds like the best version of your career, we want to meet you.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What We Offer</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">The base pay range for this role in Paris is €99,000 – €133,000. We will support relocation to Paris for great candidates.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">The base pay range for this role in New York is $108,000 – $216,000. We will support relocation to New York for great candidates.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">At Vibe, we want you to build something, own something, and grow fast. Here’s how we back that up:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Variable pay — Based on real Vibe business goals.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Hybrid flexibility — We’re in the Heart of Paris and our team is in 3x a week!</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Health insurance — Full coverage via Alan.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Meal vouchers — Via Swile.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Annual offsite — The whole team, once a year, somewhere worth the trip.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Tech Syncs — Engineering and Product meet in person at least quarterly, worldwide.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Our Interview Process</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We respect your time. Here’s exactly what to expect, no surprises, no ghosting.</p><ol style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Recruiter Screen — 30 minutes. We’ll share more context on the role and team, and learn more about your background and what you’re looking for.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Hiring Manager Interview — 45 minutes. Meet with the person you’d work with directly and dive deeper into your experience, product background, and approach to the role.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Technical Discussion — 90 minutes. A deeper conversation covering product thinking, measurement methodology, data reasoning, and a use case relevant to the role.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Bar Raiser Interview — 30 minutes. Meet with a senior leader at Vibe for a final conversation and an opportunity to ask any remaining questions.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Offer — We move quickly once we’ve made a decision. We don’t let good decisions sit.</p></li></ol><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Equal Opportunity</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Vibe is an equal opportunity employer. We evaluate all applicants without regard to race, color, religion, national origin, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, age, disability, veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by law.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We believe the best ideas come from teams with different backgrounds, perspectives, and experiences. If you need a reasonable accommodation during the application or interview process, please let us know.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Referral Instructions</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Being referred? Ask your contact to submit your application directly on your behalf.</p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/vibe/senior-product-manager-measurement-reporting-paris-334847","tags":["Engineering & Product"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Paris","created_at":1792183221},{"slug":"senior-customer-success-manager-paris-245619","company_name":"Gladia","title":"Senior Customer Success Manager","description":"<h1><strong>About Gladia </strong></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">Gladia builds the<strong> audio AI infrastructure </strong>behind the new generation of voice products. Our mission is to <strong>give every voice platform true conversational intelligence </strong>— the<strong> audio infrastructure</strong> that <strong>understands every conversation, turning voice into the world's most valuable data layer.</strong> </p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Our API turns<strong> </strong>real-world conversational audio into accurate, structured, real-time output — powered by our proprietary <strong>Solaria ASR</strong>, across 100+ languages, with industry-leading latency.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Hundreds of companies build their voice products on Gladia — from <strong>meeting assistants</strong> and <strong>voice agents to sales-enablement and contact-center platforms.</strong> We started in Paris, our growth is<strong> developer-led</strong> and<strong> heavily US-driven </strong>(and we're going after the US market hard).</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Headquartered in vibrant tech hubs like <strong>Paris </strong>and<strong> New York City, </strong>Gladia has been acquired by<strong> OVH Groupe </strong>— <strong>Europe's leading cloud provider </strong>— and now operates as a <strong>fully autonomous brand and company within the Group.</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We're guided by <strong>four values</strong>:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Honest</strong> — Say the real thing, kindly.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Smart</strong> — Work smart, ship fast.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Builders</strong> — Own your scope, build to last.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Caring</strong> — Support people, take pride in the craft.</p></li></ul><h1><br /><strong>The role</strong></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">We're looking for a<strong> Senior Customer Success Manager</strong> to own the relationship with our most strategic customers and make sure they succeed at every step — from onboarding and integration to adoption and long-term value.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You'll be the main point of contact for our customers' technical and product teams, helping them understand, adopt, and scale with our API. The role is hands-on and cross-functional: you'll work closely with Sales, Support, Product, and Engineering to drive customer outcomes.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We're an API-first company, so we're looking for someone who thrives in a technical environment and is obsessed with customer value, satisfaction, and retention. As an AI company, we also expect you to use AI every day to work smarter and serve customers better.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1><strong>What you'll do</strong></h1><h2><strong>Build a Customer Success structure that works</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Be our customers’ day-to-day point of contact and give them the support they need, when they need it</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Set up and improve our CS playbooks, onboarding flows, tooling, and metrics</p></li></ul><h2><strong>Own the customer lifecycle</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lead end-to-end onboarding for new accounts: setup, training, integration, and early activation</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Run regular check-ins with your customers, plus business reviews (QBRs) to show the value they get from Gladia</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Monitor usage and proactively support customers to drive adoption and remove friction</p></li></ul><h2><strong>Catch churn early</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build a system that surfaces early signs of churn (usage drops, health scores, support signals)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Act on those signals quickly to keep customers healthy and satisfied</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Understand each customer’s goals and help them reach them faster with Gladia</p></li></ul><h2><strong>Be the customer’s ears inside Gladia</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Collect customer needs and feedback, and bring them to Product in a structured way to shape the roadmap</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Know our roadmap well and dig into it to give customers clear answers on what’s coming</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Become a trusted advisor to technical stakeholders, product leads, and executives</p></li></ul><h2><strong>Use AI to scale Customer Success</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Use AI tools to automate repetitive work and improve CS workflows (account research, meeting prep and notes, QBR preparation, reporting)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Use AI to improve the service we give customers: faster and more accurate answers, better self-serve resources, and earlier detection of churn signals</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><h1><strong>Who you are</strong></h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">4–7+ years in Customer Success or Technical Account Management</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Previous experience with an API-first or developer-facing product</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Obsessed with customer satisfaction and retention: you spot risks before they happen, make sure customers get maximum value from the product, and build long-term, trust-based relationships</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You've managed a portfolio of strategic or enterprise customers and driven measurable value for them</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Excellent communicator — you know how to talk to developers, product managers, and executives</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Organized, autonomous, and process-driven — you're always two steps ahead</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A daily, hands-on AI user: you’ve already used AI tools to make your work or your customers’ experience better</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Fluent in English and French<br /><br /></p></li></ul><h1><strong>What Gladia offers</strong></h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">The compensation offered is based on seniority and experience, and would typically range from €50K to €75K base salary</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Hybrid work from our offices in the heart of Paris (no compulsory office days)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lunch vouchers (approx. 200€/month)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">An allowance of 360€/year for your sports activities</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">An allowance of 300€ for the adaptation of your workstation</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Health insurance (100% coverage) and a pension contract for you &amp; your family</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Flexible vacation policy</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em">Please submit your application in English. It’s our company language so you’ll be speaking lots of it if you join. </p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We treat all candidates equally - if you’re interested please apply through our careers portal.</p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/gladia/senior-customer-success-manager-paris-245619","tags":["Customer Success"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Paris","created_at":1792183221},{"slug":"growth-strategy-data-analyst-intern-paris-paris-293261","company_name":"hellofresh","title":"Growth Strategy Data Analyst - Intern (M/F/N)","description":"&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join one of France’s fastest-growing foodtech scale-ups&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;At HelloFresh, we’re transforming the way people cook and eat. Through our meal-kit boxes, we help thousands of customers cook delicious, balanced meals at home while reducing food waste and simplifying everyday life.&amp;nbsp;Operating in 15+ countries, HelloFresh is one of the world’s leading foodtech companies. The French market, launched in 2020, has experienced hyper growth and became market leader in 2021.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Behind this growth is a simple formula: technology, data, and a team of ambitious people working together to reinvent food at home.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;If you want to work at the intersection of data, strategy, and growth, and have a tangible impact on a fast-scaling business, this internship is for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Growth Strategy Data Analyst Intern, you will join the Analytics &amp;amp; Performance team and work closely with the Growth Marketing team to help drive HelloFresh’s growth in France.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will act as a data partner to business stakeholders, turning complex data into actionable insights that influence key strategic decisions, marketing investment decisions, and customer lifecycle optimization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your work will directly impact critical growth levers such as customer acquisition, retention, pricing strategy, and website optimization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role combines business analysis, experimentation, and data modeling, giving you end-to-end exposure to how data drives decisions in a growing company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for candidates who want to apply rigorous analytics to real business problems and see their insights translated into concrete growth decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work with modern analytics tools including SQL, Tableau, and Google Sheets, as well as internal data pipelines to analyze large-scale datasets and support data-driven decision-making across the Growth team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drive business-impacting analyses&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct deep-dive analyses on key growth topics such as customer acquisition, retention, pricing strategy, discount optimization, and marketing channel performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to improve conversion, marketing efficiency, and customer lifetime value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex data into clear, actionable recommendations for business stakeholders&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner with stakeholders&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Growth Marketing managers and team leads to support strategic decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present insights and recommendations that influence budget allocation and growth strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Support experimentation and A/B testing&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the design, monitoring, and analysis of A/B tests and growth experiments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure the impact of new initiatives and help scale successful strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build data products and dashboards&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and track key business KPIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain dashboards that enable the marketing team to make data-driven decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop data models, reporting pipelines, and analysis frameworks that help teams scale their decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for someone curious, analytical, and eager to tackle complex business problems using data.&amp;nbsp;You are comfortable navigating large datasets, structuring ambiguous questions, and translating analyses into insights that drive business decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical thinking and ability to structure complex business problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced proficiency in SQL, Excel / Google Sheets, and data analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with data visualization tools (Tableau is a plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate data into clear and actionable business insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational skills and ability to manage multiple projects simultaneously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gap-year or final-year student from a top engineering or business school&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience in data, consulting, strategy, or analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in French and English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Get&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A steep learning curve in one of Europe’s fastest-growing scale-ups&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to real business decisions driven by data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative and international environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discounts on HelloFresh boxes, Swile meal vouchers, and Wellpass&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Offices in the heart of Paris (1st arrondissement)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hiring Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CV review&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invitation to Case Study&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interviews with your future managers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your onboarding&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your first days will include dedicated onboarding sessions with key managers across teams to help you understand HelloFresh’s organization and business model.&amp;nbsp;You’ll then quickly dive into your projects and start contributing to the team’s impact from day one.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/hellofresh/growth-strategy-data-analyst-intern-paris-paris-293261","tags":["Growth Analytics"],"job_types":[],"location":"Paris, Paris","created_at":1792173337},{"slug":"dc-senior-supply-chain-manager-lisses-essonne-434171","company_name":"hellofresh","title":"DC Senior Supply Chain Manager (H/F/X)","description":"&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rejoins une superstar de la foodtech française&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chez HelloFresh, nous bousculons les habitudes alimentaires des français grâce à nos Box à cuisiner !&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notre ambition ?&amp;nbsp; Révolutionner le quotidien de nos abonnés, en promouvant une façon plus durable de cuisiner et en leur faisant découvrir de délicieuses recettes, créatives et équilibrées. L’alliance parfaite entre technologie et gastronomie, pour un maximum de gourmandise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HelloFresh est présent dans plus de 15 pays. La France, un jeune marché lancé en 2019, connaît une ascension fulgurante : nous y sommes déjà leaders depuis 2021. Le moment parfait pour rejoindre notre équipe et avoir un impact fort dans l&#39;une des scales up françaises les plus prometteuses !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Comment rendre tout cela possible ? Grâce à une équipe talentueuse et dynamique, des valeurs fortes de bienveillance et de diversité, et un environnement de travail stimulant.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Les missions du poste&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pour notre jeune équipe de passionnés, nous sommes à la recherche d’un.e &lt;em&gt;Responsable Supply Chain Site&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A- En tant que Responsable de l’équipe Supply Chain site:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assurer un environnement de travail sûr et sain, visant le “zéro accident”&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manager les équipes: Réception, Entrepôt, Expédition, construire les plans de développement personnel, fixer les objectifs de performance, et accompagner les équipes pour y parvenir.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Superviser l’équipe Réception dont le rôle est de recevoir, compter, contrôler, et mettre à disposition de la Production les marchandises fraîches entrantes, en quantités exactes, aux emplacements prévus et en temps voulu&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Superviser l’équipe Entrepôt dont le rôle est d’assurer la réception, le stockage et la mise à disposition des marchandises à longue conservation pour l’équipe de Production, en quantités exactes, aux emplacements prévus et en temps voulu&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Superviser l’équipe Expédition dont le rôle est la gestion de l’entreposage et du dispatching des palettes de produits finis dans les délais impartis / gestion des déchets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cadrer et optimiser les communications entre les équipes susmentionnées et les équipes FSQA (qualité), Procurement (achat et approvisionnement), et Production, pour assurer un démarrage de la production dans les meilleures conditions, chaque jour ; Être proactif et moteur dans la résolution des problèmes rencontrés&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gérer les niveaux de stock des marchandises à longue conservation et non-alimentaire ; travailler main dans la main avec l’équipe Procurement pour minimiser les pertes alimentaires&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mettre en place et optimiser les outils de suivi et de gestion de stock et mener des revues d’inventaires hebdomadairement et mensuellement en s’inspirant des pratiques existantes sur les autres sites HelloFresh&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;En collaboration avec le Responsable OPEX et le DA Production, fixer les objectifs de performances de votre équipe et concevoir la stratégie pour y parvenir&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mener une démarche d’amélioration continue basée sur les concepts de Lean Manufacturing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;B- En tant que cadre sur un site de production:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Être exemplaire en terme de sécurité au quotidien&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Toujours placer la sécurité mentale et physique du personnel, ainsi que la qualité du produit, avant les impératifs de coût&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribuer à créer un environnement de travail où l’excellence industrielle est atteinte sur le long terme en plaçant la sécurité et le bonheur au travail au centre des préoccupations au quotidien&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Faire vivre les valeurs de HelloFresh sur le site&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participer à, et si nécessaire mener, les réunions de suivi production quotidiennes et hebdomadaires&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ton Profil:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu es passionné.e par le management d’équipes en entrepôt logistique et tu aimes former ces personnels sur de nouveaux outils et processus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diplômé.e en Management de la Supply Chain ou Génie Industriel ou détenteur d’une expérience terrain équivalente, tu justifies de 3 ans d’expérience dans l’encadrement d’équipes en milieu logistique ou industriel (idéalement dans l’industrie alimentaire)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu es très à l’aise dans l’utilisation de système type WMS et ERP, idéalement tu as participé à la mise en place de tels outils par le passé&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu as une bonne capacité analytique (data, analyses…)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu as une bonne connaissance des outils du Lean Manufacturing (5S, management visuel, PDCA, VSM, TPM, ...)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu es capable de travailler en anglais (impératif) car nous évoluons dans un environnement international&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Infos complémentaires&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Véhicule indispensable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Astreintes possibles&lt;/li&gt;
