/p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We are a dynamic, collaborative team passionate about AI and its potential to transform society. Our diverse workforce thrives in competitive environments and is committed to driving innovation. Our teams are distributed between Europe, North America, Asia and the Middle East. We are creative, low-ego and team-spirited.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>About the job</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">Mistral builds AI systems that enterprises run on their own terms, in finance, manufacturing, defense, healthcare, and the public sector. The Solutions organization turns customers' hardest problems into AI they own, run, and scale on Mistral. It is one of the fastest-growing functions in the company: 650 people by end of 2026, across EMEA, the US, and Asia-Pacific, delivering measurable business outcomes for enterprise customers worldwide.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">The Solutions organization includes Deployment Strategists, Applied AI Engineers, Infrastructure Solution Architects, and Applied Scientists. They work with enterprise customers from pre-sales through implementation and deliver AI systems that produce measurable business outcomes.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Solutions Operations is the function that makes this scale. It runs staffing and capacity planning across regions, the go-to-market motion by industry vertical and capability, delivery processes and tooling, the data behind our decisions, and value and customer-success measurement, with hubs in Europe, North America, and Asia-Pacific.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We are hiring a <strong>Head of Solutions Operations</strong>. We are looking for an entrepreneurial COO or a former Forward Deployed Engineer with years of experience. This is a build-the-1-to-10 role: you will take a young, fast-growing function and turn it into the operating system that lets Solutions scale from hundreds to thousands of people without losing what makes it work. You will lead a team of program leads and regional operators across three continents, and work as a business partner to Solutions leadership.</p><h2><br />What you will do</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Own the Solutions operating system end to end.</strong> One process from pre-sales to post-sales, a single source of truth for people, projects, and opportunities, the Solutions tooling stack, and safety, security, and compliance built into how the team works.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Industrialize what already works.</strong> Turn delivery and vertical playbooks, staffing frameworks, and the value and ROI methodology into reusable assets the whole team runs on, and drive their adoption in every geography.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Build the global operating model.</strong> Keep core operations centralized while ensuring real adoption and the right local adaptation across EMEA, the US, and Asia-Pacific, with full-stack regional operators on the ground.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Staff demanding customer engagements.</strong> Own capacity planning and forecasting, skills-to-project matching, time-to-staff, utilization, and bench health across all geographies.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Make customer success measurable.</strong> Stand up delivery-outcome measurement and customer-satisfaction systems, and run the feedback loop that turns field learnings into product requirements and reusable IP.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Make AI-native operations the default.</strong> Build internal tools, agents, and automations that remove manual work from planning, staffing, reporting, and delivery follow-ups, starting with your own team.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Lead and grow the team.</strong> Hire, mentor, and develop program leads and regional operators, raise the technical bar of the function, and build the hiring plan for its next phase.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Partner across functions.</strong> Work daily with Solutions leadership, regional Sales leadership, Product and Engineering, RevOps, and Talent Acquisition, and bring executive judgment on where to invest, slow down, or say no.</p></li></ul><h2><br />How We Work in Solutions</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">We care about people and outputs. What matters is what you ship.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">The best idea wins, whether it comes from a principal engineer or someone in their first week.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Always ask why. The best solutions come from deep understanding, not copying what worked before.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">We say what we mean. Feedback is direct and given because we care. No politics. Low ego, high standards.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">We embrace an unstructured environment and find joy in it.</p></li></ul><h2><br />About you</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">Whatever your path, you bring:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Extensive leadership experience</strong>, with demonstrated impact building and leading teams or functions in a fast-scaling environment.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A track record of <strong>industrializing something handcrafted but working</strong>: processes, systems, and teams that scaled an order of magnitude without losing what made them work.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">The ability to <strong>bring structure to ambiguity</strong> and drive complex, cross-functional initiatives from strategy through execution. You are hands-on and biased toward action.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Data-driven and AI-fluent</strong>: you build the internal tools, automations, dashboards, and AI workflows you rely on.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Global operating range</strong>: you work naturally across geographies and cultures, with the executive presence to hold a room with C-level stakeholders and the credibility to challenge senior leaders.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Stakeholder management</strong>: you align competing priorities and drive decisions without formal authority.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Fluent in English</strong>; additional languages are a plus.</p></li></ul><h2>Ideally</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience in enterprise software, AI, or deep-tech delivery, or top-tier strategy consulting on complex technical transformations.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience operating at global scale across EMEA, the US, and Asia-Pacific.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Hands-on experience building AI-native operations: automating workflows with LLMs and agents rather than prompting a chatbot.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">MBA or advanced degree preferred.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>What We Offer</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">We offer a comprehensive benefits package designed to support your well-being, growth, and work-life balance. Benefits vary by country and may include healthcare coverage, parental leave, retirement plans, relocation support, wellness programs, meal and transportation allowances, and other location-specific perks.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">For the most up-to-date details on benefits available in your location, please refer to our <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://app.notion.com/p/mistralai/Benefits-at-Mistral-36e6ba59a7fe836b93dd01737fcc27ef?source=copy_link">Benefits page</a>.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>Privacy Policy</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">Your privacy matters to us. You can learn more about how we handle your personal data in our <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https