&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are intentional about connection. Our global community, spanning over 20 offices worldwide, is united by a drive to innovate. Your journey begins with an immersive, in-person onboarding experience designed to accelerate your impact and connect you to our mission and team from day one.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Okta is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, ancestry, marital status, age, physical or mental disability, or status as a protected veteran. We also consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and convictions records, consistent with applicable laws.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If reasonable accommodation is needed to complete any part of the job application, interview process, or onboarding please&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1EfiEYZrIyhA2X4Fijk0R3RKYOzNoS3wtvyM4nhbZnXE/edit&quot;&gt;use this Form&lt;/a&gt; to request an accommodation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Notice for New York City Applicants &amp;amp; Employees: Okta may use Automated Employment Decision Tools (AEDT), as defined by New York City Local Law 144, that use artificial intelligence, machine learning, or other automated processes to assist in our recruitment and hiring process. In accordance with NYC Local Law 144, if you are an applicant or employee residing in New York City, please&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://talent.okta.com/new-york-city-aedt-notice.html&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; to view our full NYC AEDT Notice.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/okta/technical-account-manager-auth0-paris-25814","tags":["Technical Account Management-812"],"job_types":[],"location":"Paris","created_at":1792162521},{"slug":"head-of-engineering-lyon-44409","company_name":"Arkane Cloud","title":"Head of Engineering","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em">Des centaines de GPU NVIDIA dernière génération, des clusters à multiplier, des sites à ouvrir : Arkane Cloud cherche son Head of Infrastructure pour porter la croissance d’un cloud GPU français et souverain.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Arkane Cloud</strong></p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em">Arkane Cloud est un Cloud Service Provider lyonnais qui rend la puissance de calcul IA accessible, abordable et disponible en quelques minutes. Grâce à notre propre infrastructure GPU, startups, chercheurs et entreprises déploient leurs modèles d’IA sans se battre avec la technique :</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Jusqu’à 70 % d’économies par rapport à un hyperscaler.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Une plateforme Plug &amp; Play prête en moins de 3 minutes.</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em">Notre ambition : bâtir un acteur européen de référence de l’infrastructure IA.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Pourquoi ce poste ?</strong></p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em">Spécialisé dans l’IA-as-a-Service et GPU-as-a-Service, nous avons une infrastructure allant d'A5000 jusqu’au NVIDIA HGX B300 (InfiniBand XDR, stockage VAST Data). Nous créons ce poste pour nous accompagner dans les futurs déploiements, puis multiplier les clusters et les sites, avec une équipe qui grandit en parallèle.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em">C’est un poste de bâtisseur : vous êtes responsable de l’infrastructure de bout en bout, de la commande du matériel au GPU disponible pour le client.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Vos missions</strong></p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Concevoir et déployer les clusters GPU (HGX B300, GB300, Vera Rubin) selon les référence architectures NVIDIA.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Porter le réseau et le stockage : InfiniBand XDR, RoCE v2, connectivité externe, VAST Data.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Choisir et négocier data centers et fournisseurs : colocation, énergie, refroidissement liquide, NVIDIA, OEM, intégrateurs.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Tenir le SLA : supervision, astreinte, incidents, automatisation, volet infrastructure d’ISO 27001 puis SecNumCloud.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Construire et manager l’équipe infrastructure et DevOps, et piloter le TCO et le revenu par GPU.</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Vos 6 premiers mois</strong></p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>1er mois :</em> le cluster HGX B300 est en production, recetté et conforme à la référence architecture NVIDIA.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>3 mois :</em> astreinte et process d’incident en place, plan de capacité à 12 mois validé, contrats fournisseurs clés sécurisés.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>6 mois </em>: nouveau cluster ou site déployé dans les délais et le budget, SLA tenu et mesuré, recrutements clés réalisés, ISO 27001 prête pour l’audit côté infrastructure.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Votre expérience</strong></p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">10 ans ou plus en infrastructure, dont 3 ans au moins à la tête d’une équipe infrastructure GPU.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Au moins un cluster de plusieurs centaines de GPU NVIDIA (HGX) livré en personne</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Vos expertises</strong></p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Réseaux haute performance : InfiniBand ou RoCE v2 (rail-optimized, fat-tree, gestion de fabric).</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Data center : colocation, contraintes électriques et thermiques, refroidissement liquide ou plus de 120 kW par baie.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Négociation de contrats matériel et colocation.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Exploitation en production : SLA, astreinte, gestion d’incidents.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Anglais professionnel courant.</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em"><u>Un vrai plus :</u></p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Expérience chez un cloud provider, un neocloud GPU ou un acteur HPC ;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Kubernetes et orchestration GPU (GPU Operator, MIG, Slurm) ;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Infrastructure as code ;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Stockage haute performance ;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Stack d’inférence (vLLM, SGLang) ;</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Pourquoi nous rejoindre</strong></p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em">Des choix à prendre, pas à subir : vous décidez de l’architecture d’un matériel de toute dernière génération.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Un vrai rôle de direction : rattaché au CEO, avec un impact direct sur la trajectoire et les financements de l’entreprise.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Une fonction à bâtir : process, équipe, sites.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Un cloud souverain français : une alternative européenne aux hyperscalers, avec une équipe resserrée et des décisions rapides.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Package et avantages</strong></p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">100 à 120 k€ brut annuel fixe</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">BSPCE</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Télétravail flexible, deux jours de présence à Lyon toutes les deux semaines (défrayés). Des déplacements réguliers en data center à Paris et chez les fournisseurs sont à prévoir.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Mutuelle à 100 %, tickets restaurant, RTT (Convention Syntec)</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>Arkane Cloud s’engage pour la diversité : nous étudions toutes les candidatures, sans distinction de genre, d’âge, d’origine ou de handicap</em>.</p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/arkane-cloud/head-of-engineering-lyon-44409","tags":["Engineering"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Lyon","created_at":1792161620},{"slug":"senior-embedded-performance-engineer-zurich-404854","company_name":"Auterion","title":"Senior Embedded Performance Engineer","description":"&lt;p&gt;Auterion builds a cutting-edge operating system for autonomous robotic systems that empower a diverse range of platforms to perform surveillance, reconnaissance, inspection, mapping and logistics tasks. Our industry-leading software drives the adoption of robotic fleets and is recognized by the U.S. government as the future standard for its drone programs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Embedded Performance Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; who is passionate about getting the most out of embedded systems — from low-level Linux tuning and hardware integration to high-performance video and data pipelines. This role is ideal for someone who enjoys working close to hardware, moving across the stack, and solving the kinds of problems where milliseconds, bandwidth, startup time, and system efficiency matter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work across the AuterionOS ecosystem on topics such as:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embedded Linux performance and system tuning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Low-latency video streaming and media pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;C/C++, Python, and Bash-based platform development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hardware integration, system profiling, and end-to-end optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaboration with experienced and driven engineers across Auterion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work within the Apps &amp;amp; Simulation team and collaborate with other development teams to build high-performance products for autonomous systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, optimize, and maintain performance-critical components within AuterionOS, Auterion’s custom embedded Linux distribution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve end-to-end system behavior across compute, networking, video, and hardware interfaces, with a strong focus on latency, throughput, reliability, and resource efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze and optimize demanding workloads such as real-time telemetry, video streaming, media processing, and communication between distributed system components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate system bottlenecks across the full stack, from kernel and OS behavior to application-level code and tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with engineering and product teams to understand both internal and customer use cases, and translate them into robust technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Propose and implement new platform capabilities with a strong emphasis on measurable performance gains in real-world deployments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in daily stand-ups, release planning, and prioritization discussions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications and Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;B.Sc. or M.Sc. in Computer Science, Software Engineering, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of professional experience writing object-oriented C++ and/or Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience with embedded Linux systems, including cross-compilation, debugging, profiling, and performance tuning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hands-on background in diagnosing and optimizing real-world system behavior, including CPU, memory, I/O, networking, boot time, and application latency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or optimizing low-latency video or data-streaming pipelines, ideally on embedded platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent understanding of software systems that span embedded devices, higher-level applications, and fully integrated products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong software engineering fundamentals, including system design, implementation, debugging, and testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with video codecs, GStreamer, RTP/RTSP, or hardware-accelerated media pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid experience with Debian/Ubuntu-based systems, Bash scripting, and systemd.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Docker and docker-compose in complex development and deployment environments, as well as qemu.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong debugging and performance analysis skills at both system and application level, combined with a proactive and self-directed working style.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in ROS2/DDS-style middleware and experienced with networking across multiple OSI layers, including REST APIs and performance-sensitive communication paths.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with system integration and interfacing sensors or peripherals, especially via USB and Ethernet.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in an agile engineering environment with stand-ups, sprint planning, and shared ownership across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus: Experience with build systems such as CMake, including improving build performance in large-scale software projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stock Options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous holiday allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company pension plan&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Car parking&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced maternity &amp;amp; paternity leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health and wellbeing support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning and development opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Auterion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building the leading software platform for AI-powered autonomous systems for enterprise and government customers. Our team is supporting the most important missions and solving the most challenging problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Auterion, we bring together the sharpest minds who love to solve the hardest problems. Join a vibrant team built on innovation, openness, and excellence, where you’ll be empowered to develop ideas, collaborate across all levels, and make an impact that matters.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.ch/jobs/companies/auterion/senior-embedded-performance-engineer-zurich-404854","tags":["Engineering"],"job_types":[],"location":"Zurich","created_at":1792227318},{"slug":"product-safety-certification-engineer-fuel-cell-systems-nyon-112986","company_name":"Eh Group","title":"Product Safety & Certification Engineer - Fuel Cell Systems","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>About EH Group Engineering</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">EHG is developing cutting-edge fuel cell technology for heavy duty mobility and large-scale stationary power applications. Our uniquely redesigned product is a significantly more compact fuel cell with high power density and lower costs of production. Faced with the challenges of climate change and the transition to a decentralised energy system, EHG seeks to provide high performance and cost-effective fuel cell solutions to our clients and partners.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">To help achieve our vision of a decarbonised future we are seeking a Functional Safety Engineer to embed safety into our fuel cell systems, leading hazard analysis and safety engineering across hardware, software and controls to ensure our products are safe, compliant and certifiable.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">This role requires full-time, on-site presence at our Nyon, Switzerland office. We're not able to offer remote or hybrid arrangements, so candidates should be prepared to relocate.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>K