<li><strong>Collaborative finance team:</strong> Work closely with finance colleagues, external tax advisors, and payroll providers.</li>
<li><strong>Organizational stability:</strong> Enjoy the opportunity to work within an established international group while retaining the benefits of an agile, entrepreneurial team.</li>
<li><strong>Competitive compensation:</strong> Salary and any additional financial benefits to be confirmed during the recruitment process.</li>
